'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">支付宝正式上线AI开放平台，支持“阿宝”智能体跨端分发至车机与IoT设备</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">xAI正式更名为SpaceXAI，完成并入SpaceX体系后的品牌整合</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta被曝雇佣外包人员诱导ChatGPT等竞品AI测试极端敏感话题</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国网络安全局启用Anthropic的Mythos模型审计政府代码并解除出口限制</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/72a61727a122c383636ff6a52d4fbb43.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国网络安全与基础设施安全局（CISA）正利用Anthropic开发的AI模型“Mythos”对政府软件代码进行全面审计，以识别潜在安全漏洞。该工作由CISA内部“攻击面评估”团队执行，旨在防范外国情报机构及网络犯罪分子的威胁。此前，Anthropic曾因拒绝移除自主武器防护措施被五角大楼列入风险名单，后通过向国家安全机构提供Mythos模型缓解关系，该模型在NSA的漏洞挖掘测试中表现优异。此外，白宫已于上周正式解除对Anthropic合规模型“Fable”的全球访问限制，撤销了此前实施的出口管制。目前，美国国家安全机构正持续评估该AI技术，以强化数字攻防能力。此次合作标志着政府在关键基础设施安全领域对AI审计工具的深度整合，对提升政府代码安全性具有重要意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团正式开源LongCat-2.0大模型，实现国产算力集群全链路适配</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8efebf243afb6686b513a45b7a7ba53f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团于7月6日正式开源基础大模型LongCat-2.0，该模型是业界首个完全依托国产算力芯片完成训练与推理的大模型。LongCat-2.0于6月30日发布，其训练与推理过程均在五万卡国产算力集群上完成，验证了国产芯片处理万亿参数级模型的高效能与稳定性。美团此次采用MIT开源协议，将模型权重、推理引擎及核心技术文档同步上线GitHub、Hugging Face和ModelScope，支持开发者免费商用。同日，华为昇腾、摩尔线程和沐曦股份宣布完成对LongCat-2.0的推理适配，标志着“国产芯片+国产大模型”的软硬件协同生态进一步成熟。此次开源旨在降低中小企业布局前沿AI技术的门槛，为中国人工智能产业的自主可控提供技术支撑，并有望通过开源生态加速国产AI技术的迭代与应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">支付宝正式上线AI开放平台，支持“阿宝”智能体跨端分发至车机与IoT设备</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8a1cb4d6d69a11547a2bc05fc94bc6f0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">支付宝今日正式上线AI开放平台，并面向企业开发者及代开发服务商开启邀测。该平台核心功能在于支持商家将现有小程序、API接口升级为AI可调用的智能体，实现“一次接入，多端分发”的全新模式。通过该平台，商家的AI服务可跨端互联，一键分发至手机、车机、AI眼镜及各类IoT智能终端，无需针对不同终端进行重复研发与适配。平台作为中间层统一完成协议转换，并提供托管、分发、交易及结算等全链路支持。支付宝强调，AI化升级不会影响原有小程序业务，两套系统将并行运行。此外，平台整合了支付宝在身份核验、支付安全、交易存证及风险防控等领域的技术积淀，为商家提供安全可信的AI服务基础设施。此举旨在降低商家多端布局的研发成本，通过统一管理模式，助力商家将服务触达支付宝10亿用户及外部智能终端，实现AI化经营价值的闭环。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">xAI正式更名为SpaceXAI，完成并入SpaceX体系后的品牌整合</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc511d26f00f08800af7219268ce773e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">xAI今日正式更名为SpaceXAI，标志着该公司在完成被SpaceX收购后，已全面并入SpaceX业务体系。此次品牌重塑紧随SpaceX今年6月IPO之后，旨在强化航天、AI与卫星通信的协同效应。数据显示，SpaceX在2025年的AI资本性支出高达127亿美元，远超其航天与星链业务投入。公司战略核心已转向AI，计划最早于2028年部署“AI计算卫星”。目前，SpaceX已凭借Colossus数据中心算力，与Anthropic及谷歌达成每月数亿美元的算力接入合作。此次整合不仅将旗舰聊天机器人Grok纳入统一架构，更明确了SpaceX将AI计算能力向轨道部署的长期战略，旨在构建覆盖全球的轨道算力新霸权。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta被曝雇佣外包人员诱导ChatGPT等竞品AI测试极端敏感话题</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d5b256fb8d19e8a800496f952486380f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta曾开展代号为“Cannes”的项目，通过外包公司Covalen雇佣数百人伪装成未成年人，对ChatGPT、Gemini及Character.AI等竞品进行极限压力测试。该项目至少持续至2026年4月21日，测试员创建虚假账号，频繁发送自杀、自残、进食障碍等高风险提示词，并上传刀具、药片等图片，旨在诱导竞品AI绕过安全拦截机制。仅2025年8月的一轮测试中，输入的高风险提示词就超过4.5万个。Meta发言人对此辩护称，对聊天机器人进行基准测试是确保AI产品安全与适龄的行业标准做法，并明确否认利用此类数据训练自家模型。此举引发行业对AI安全测试边界及青少年保护机制的广泛争议，凸显了生成式AI在处理极端敏感话题时的脆弱性，以及竞争行为与道德伦理之间的灰色地带。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
